The '''Snow Mountain''' is an [[Locations|island]].

The island is made up of two mountains connected by a bridge. On one mountain, the player can find the [[Snow Quest Giver]], as well as the [[Snow Trooper]]s. On the other mountain, the player can find the [[Winter Warrior]]s. 

