==Trivia==
* The player can destroy the bridge when using a [[Destructible Physics]] move.
** The player cannot cross the bridge while having [[Dough]]'s awakened {{Ability|Dough|F|2}} or [[Blizzard]]'s {{Ability|Blizzard|F}} as the bridge will break from too many hits, since those attacks have continuous ticks. 
* The player can spawn a [[Sea Beast]] between the mountains; Sea Beasts can also spawn naturally there.
* The Snow Mountain is hollow, so if the player angles their camera correctly, they can use Flash Step to get inside.
* The Snow Mountain had a [[Poneglyphs|Poneglyph]] but it was later removed in [[Updates/13|Update 13]].
* [[Control]], prior to it's rework, was known to pick up the entire bridge and throw it, resulting in an explosion that covers the entire island.

